## **Device Changelog** ##

**miatoll (24/02/2025)**

```bash
- Fixed an issue where LiveDisplay's Picture Adjustment no visual changes
- Added IPSEC Tunnel Migration feature
- Bump manifest level from 5 to 6
- Upgrade soundtrigger HAL from v2.2 to v2.3
- Upgrade tetheroffload control HAL from v1.0 to v1.1
```

**miatoll (18/02/2025)**

```bash
- Switched back to prebuilt audio
- Reduced swappiness to 60 (Should improve memory management in heavy apps)
```

**miatoll (16/02/2025)**

```bash
- Fixed an issue where calling using VOIP apps failed to work properly
- Fixed an issue where mic are too sensitive causing echo
```

**miatoll (13/02/2025)**

```bash
- Rebased whole trees onto Lineage 22.1 and had major cleanup
- Added minor tuning to powerhint
- Added av1 software decoder and encoder entries
- Switched to OSS Audio
- Upgraded adreno driver to v805 from v797
```

**miatoll (05/02/2025)**

```bash
- Improvement to auto brightness ramping rate
- Improvement to mic on video recording
- Fixed an issue where new notifications will caused call distortion
- Deep_buffer will be default for audio playback
- Minor changes to audio configs
- Uprev Audio HAL from v6 to v7
- Added back few audio media properties
```

**miatoll (02/01/2025)**

```bash
- Added back LTE_CA option
- Tweaked left clock padding to align with launcher's smartspace
```

**miatoll (25/12/2024)**

```bash
- Added CNE Symlinks
- Reverted back to Adreno v797 (Improves performance on newer games)
- Switched back to AIDL Fingerprint HAL
- Switched to device specific thermal configs
```

**miatoll (14/12/2024)**

```bash
- Reverted back to Adreno v502 for stability
```

**miatoll (09/12/2024)**

```bash
- Initial Android 15 QPR1 build
- Spoofs Netflix to Xiaomi 14 Ultra
```

**miatoll (24/11/2024)**

```bash
- Switched back to HIDL FP HAL (Should fixed FPC users in Private Space)
- Added missing domains sockets for thermal-engine
```

**miatoll (12/11/2024)**

```bash
- Added ZRAM tweaks to match with kernel memory management changes
- Nuked latch unsignal buffers properties
- Re-adjust brightness ramping rates 
- Switched to AIDL Thermal HAL
- Updated system blobs to LA.QSSI.15.0.r1-10500-qssi.0
```

**miatoll (31/10/2024)**

```bash
- Included kinesis omega r6.0
- Added improvement to wifi configs
- Reconfigure ZRAM as per Qualcomm Android Go tuning guide
```

**miatoll (31/10/2024)**

```bash
- Fixed stock recovery shows lib_fsmgr error message
- User build (Improve custom rom detection for certain apps)
```

**miatoll (23/10/2024)**

```bash
- Added more prebuilt audio blobs
- Dropped more unused blobs
- Enabled ELF checks
- Update adreno driver to v797 (Oculus Quest 2)
```

**miatoll (17/10/2024)**

```bash
- Switched to Lineage implementation of AIDL interface for Fingerprint HAL
- Switched to AIDL interface for USB HAL
```

**miatoll (11/10/2024)**

```bash
- Disabled turbulence noise (Having the turbulence noise play causes frame drops on mid to lower-end devices)
```

**miatoll (01/10/2024)**

```bash
- Fixed an issue where fingerprint indicator is out of the place
- Switched to AIDL interface for Health HAL
- Switched to AIDL interface for Sensor HAL
```

**miatoll (29/09/2024)**

```bash
- Switched to AIDL Fingerprint HAL (Lesser spamming fingerprint issue logs in the background, RIP HIDL by Google)
```

**miatoll (16/09/2024)**

```bash
- Initial Android 15 release
```

**miatoll (06/09/2024)**

```bash
- Should fixed an issue that might caused charging stucked
- Updated adreno driver to august compiled date from Oculus Quest 2 (improvement on stability)
```

**miatoll (31/08/2024)**

```bash
- Increase charging temperature threshold
- Reverted some auto brightness changes
- Skipped nativeDetachImage
